editor_description = "A house of the lane by the abbey gate: two floors, 6 m wide: rubble below with a round-headed door, a deep jetty on heavy braces, grey-blue plaster, eaves to the lane with a gablet (tools/build/env_house_timber.py). Its front faces -Z, the ground floor's face at z = 0; it runs back 9 m. Panes named in lit_windows glow. The lane hangs its lantern (StreetLanterns in street.tscn)."

